Wine win32u: keep the timeline of a shared D3D12 fence in shared memory, so another process can open the fence and wait on it. The Fenix displays in GPU mode open a fence the simulator shares; without this the display process exits a few seconds after it starts.
Applies to wine-cachyos with: patch -p1 --forward --fuzz=0 -i <this file>

